      "text": "record on 24 gold plates called Book of Ether, Ether 1:2, 6. son of Coriantor, Ether 1:6 (11:23). prophet in days of Coriantumr2, Ether 12:1–2. prophesies great and marvelous things, Ether 12:5. is rejected, Ether 13:2. speaks of Christ and New Jerusalem, Ether 13:4. hides in cave, views destruction of Jaredites, Ether 13:13–14, 18. calls Coriantumr2 to repentance, Ether 13:20–22. Ether’s prophecies are fulfilled, Ether 13:21, 24. Ether’s words remembered by Coriantumr2, Ether 15:1. watches, but does not join others, Ether 15:12–13. finishes and hides record, Ether 15:33. last words, Ether 15:34.",
